'''Wetyin's Colony''' was the main settlement on the [[moon]] [[Yavin 4]] that was established when settlers traveled from the [[planet]] [[Setor]] to become [[farmer]]s.<ref name="Free Fall" /> In the [[Standard month|months]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], [[Shara Bey]] and [[Kes Dameron]] settled in a new home in the colony after completing their service in the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]. Having their own home had been their dream after being separated from one another, as well as their son, [[Poe Dameron|Poe]], for much of the [[Galactic Civil War]]. Upon moving into their [[Dameron homestead|new home]], the [[Marriage|couple]] planted one of two remaining fragments of a [[Great Tree (Coruscant)|Great Tree]] that had once dwelled in the heart of the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]], after Bey and [[Luke Skywalker]] [[Mission to Vetine|recovered]] them from the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Shattered Empire 4" /> During the [[New Republic Era]], Poe Dameron grew up in Wetyin's Colony before leaving his home to join the [[Spice Runners of Kijimi]], who he met in the local [[cantina]], [[Gully's]].<ref name="Free Fall" />

